<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82275" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστολ-ή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wrapping up</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστολῇ καὶ κατακλίσει συνθάλπειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.652e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>laying out</i>, of a corpse, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				3.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				896.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Medic., <i>peristaltic action</i> of internal organs, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.440
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαστέρος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					7.219
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλεβῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Nat.Fac.</u>
					2.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>adornments</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ex.</u>
				33.6
			</span></i> : metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. δόξης</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Si.</u>
				45.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>restraint, decorum</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅσα
				παίζεται μετὰ περιστολῆς</span> Aristeas <i><span class="en">
				284
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν π</span>. <i>secretly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Psalm.Solom.
				13.7
			</span></i>.</div>
